        "wild": "Hyaenodon dirus is an opportunistic pack predator that targets weakened or isolated creatures. It is cowardly when alone but emboldened in numbers, and a pack of Hyaenodons can overwhelm prey far larger than themselves. They are cunning hunters that will wait for the right moment before striking.",
